---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Koedo Kawagoe Kurazukuri Street｜Nishikino｜WORKS"
  description=""
>


<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/kawagoekurazukuri-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/kawagoe.jpg"
      alt="Kurazukuri Streetscape"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          KOEDO KAWAGOE　KURAZUKURI STREET
        </p>


        <!-- Title -->

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          小江戸川越<br>蔵造りの町並み
        </h1>


        <!-- Subtitle -->

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          A traditional Japanese streetscape where the atmosphere of Edo lives on.
        </p>


        <!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>


        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>


  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />


  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">


    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Overview
      </h2>


      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Koedo Kawagoe Kurazukuri Street is a historic streetscape and one of the most representative landmarks of Kawagoe City, Saitama Prefecture.<br>
        Kawagoe developed as a commercial town from the Edo period, and its streetscape of imposing kurazukuri merchant houses came to be known as “Koedo,” or “Little Edo.” Even today, the area retains a strong sense of its historic character.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl">
    </div>



    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          About Kawagoe Ichibangai Shopping Street Kurazukuri Streetscape
        </h2>


        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          Koedo Kawagoe Ichibangai Kurazukuri Streetscape in Kawagoe City, Saitama Prefecture, is a historic streetscape that remains in the central urban area of Kawagoe, which developed as a castle town during the Edo period.
          Kawagoe flourished as the castle town of the Kawagoe Domain and developed greatly as a hub for logistics and commerce through waterborne transportation with Edo.

          <br><br>

          The event that led to the formation of the present-day kurazukuri streetscape was the “Kawagoe Great Fire,” which occurred in 1893 (Meiji 26).
          Following the fire, many merchant houses were rebuilt using earthen-storehouse construction with improved fire resistance, creating rows of buildings characterized by the distinctive features of kurazukuri architecture, including imposing black plaster walls, double-leaf doors, tiled roofs, and mushikomado windows.

          <br><br>

          Many kurazukuri merchant houses, traditional townhouses, temples, storehouses, and other buildings that retain the character of the former streetscape have been preserved to this day.
          As an area where visitors can experience the atmosphere passed down from the Edo period to the Meiji period and from the Meiji period into the present day, it has also been designated an “Important Preservation District for Groups of Traditional Buildings,” recognizing its high historical and cultural value.

          <br><br>

          This work faithfully recreates this historic streetscape as a realistic Japanese-style Minecraft build.
          Its faithful recreation based not on architectural drawings but on old photographs and the actual streetscape was featured in the news, bringing the work to the attention of a very large audience.
          The building process and completed work have also been shared on X and YouTube.

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Work</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Koedo Kawagoe Ichibangai Shopping Street Kurazukuri Streetscape
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Category</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Japanese Architecture & Traditional Streetscape
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Origin</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Edo Period, Kan'ei Era — Town Planning from 1639
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Location</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Saiwaicho & Nakacho area, Kawagoe City, Saitama 350-0063, Japan (Kawagoe Ichibangai Shopping Street)
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Formation of Present Streetscape</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                1893 (Meiji 26, rebuilt after the Kawagoe Great Fire)
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Features</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Kurazukuri Buildings, Shops & Residences
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Software</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Minecraft Java Edition 1.21.4–1.21.8
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Work Type</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Japanese Architecture & Streetscape Recreation
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Status</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Completed
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Gallery
      </h2>


      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe1.png"
            alt="Kawagoe Ichibangai"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe.jpg"
            alt="Kawagoe Ichibangai"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe2.png"
            alt="Kawagoe Ichibangai"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe3.png"
            alt="Kawagoe Ichibangai in reality"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/en/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← Back to Works
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://x.com/nishikinolab/status/1908105135102058944/photo/1"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        View More Works →
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/cont/articles/3398021/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        View Feature →
      </a>


      <div class="mt-32 w-full text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          Share This Work
        </h2>


        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <!-- X -->

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>


          <!-- Instagram -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>


          <!-- Copy -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Copy URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>



<script>

  const sharePhrases = [
    "Found this.",
    "I kind of like this.",
    "Look at this.",
    "Found something interesting.",
    "Found something like this.",
    "Have you seen this?",
    "Found something.",
    "Came across this.",
    "Found something worth checking out."
  ];


  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[
      Math.floor(
        Math.random() * sharePhrases.length
      )
    ];


  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/en/kawagoekurazukuri/";


  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft KAWAGOE KURAZUKURI STREETSCAPE | WORKS`;


  const xShare =
    document.getElementById("x-share");


  if (xShare) {

    xShare.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );

  }


  const copyButton =
    document.getElementById("copy-url");


  const instagramButton =
    document.getElementById("instagram-share");


  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "Copied";

        setTimeout(() => {

          copyButton.textContent = "Copy URL";

        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });


  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog =
      document.createElement("div");


    dialog.innerHTML = `

      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>


          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            Share on Instagram
          </h3>


          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            Copy the URL of this work page<br>
            and open Instagram.
          </p>


          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Copy URL and Open Instagram
          </button>


          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Cancel
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    `;


    document.body.appendChild(dialog);


    const overlay =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-share-overlay"
      );


    const openButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-open"
      );


    const cancelButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-cancel"
      );


    openButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      async () => {

        try {

          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
            pageUrl
          );

        } catch (error) {

          console.error(error);

        }


        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );


        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    cancelButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      () => {

        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    overlay?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (event) => {

        if (event.target === overlay) {

          overlay.remove();

        }

      }
    );

  });

</script>


<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
    heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
    center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
      scale(1.06)
      translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

}


section {

  position:
    relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
    "";

  position:
    absolute;

  left:
    0;

  top:
    0;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    100%;

  pointer-events:
    none;

  background-image:

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 8% 10%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.08),
      transparent 18%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 92% 82%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.06),
      transparent 22%
    );

}


aside {

  position:
    sticky;

  top:
    120px;

  height:
    max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
    .35s;

}




.gallery-frame {

  position:
    relative;

  padding:
    2px;

  border-radius:
    1.25rem;

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow:
    hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
    block;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    auto;

  border-radius:
    calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
    #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
      hidden;

  }


}


@media (max-width:900px) {

  .gallery {

    grid-template-columns:
      1fr;

  }


  aside {

    position:
      relative;

    top:
      auto;

  }


}


@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
      760px;

  }



  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
      1rem;

  }


  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
      calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}

</style>

</Layout>